"DECODE SPEED · TOK/S" = "解码速度 · TOK/S";
"Decode speed (tok/s): the last %lld samples taken while a request is generating, every %@ (span and UI refresh in Settings). Samples are evenly spaced by count, not by wall-clock time — idle gaps don't stretch them. The dotted line is the average of the samples shown. Right-click to pick the line's color." = "解码速度(tok/s):请求生成期间按每 %2$@ 采样(采样跨度与 UI 刷新在“设置”中配置),记录的是最近 %1$lld 个样本。样本按数量均匀分布,而不是按时间 — 空闲间隔不会把它们拉长。虚线是所显示样本的平均值。右键可选择线条颜色。";
"LAST REQUEST" = "最近请求";
"Figures for the most recently finished request, from splash's Done log line." = "最近一次已完成请求的数据,来自 splash 的 Done 日志行。";
"LOAD" = "负载";
"Server-wide totals and averages since splash started." = "splash 启动以来服务器范围的总计与平均值。";
"SERVER" = "服务器";
"What splash is serving and where." = "splash 正在提供什么服务、位于哪里。";
"external" = "外部";
"This server wasn't started by Splash Menu Bar (e.g. run from a terminal). Stop still shuts it down; quitting the app leaves it running." = "该服务器不是由 Splash Menu Bar 启动的(例如从终端运行)。按“停止”仍会将其关闭;退出应用则它继续运行。";
"Unpin" = "取消固定";
"Pin" = "固定";
"Pinned: this panel stays open until you unpin it, and you can drag it anywhere by its top edge. Click to unpin and snap it back under the menu bar." = "已固定:此面板保持打开,直到你取消固定;可按住其顶边将其拖到任意位置。点击可取消固定,并将其贴回菜单栏下方。";
"Pin this panel open, so clicking elsewhere, pressing Esc or using its buttons doesn't close it. Pinned, you can drag it anywhere on screen by its top edge." = "固定此面板使其保持打开:点击其他位置、按 Esc 或使用其按钮都不会关闭它。固定后,可按住其顶边把它拖到屏幕任意位置。";
"Settings (⌘,): edit the splash serve options. Saving restarts the server." = "设置(⌘,):编辑 splash serve 选项。保存后服务器会重启。";
"Starting splash…" = "正在启动 splash…";
"What splash is doing before it can serve: the current stage, download progress (size · speed · time left), time since launch, and its latest output line." = "splash 在可提供服务之前正在做什么:当前阶段、下载进度(大小 · 速度 · 剩余时间)、启动以来的时间,以及它最新的输出行。";
"splash exited" = "splash 已退出";
"splash exited: %@. The lines below are its last output; select the text to copy it. Press Start to run it again." = "splash 已退出:%@。下方是它最后的输出;选中文字即可复制。按“启动”可再次运行它。";
"A splash server started outside the app is serving port %lld, so the app uses that one. Restart runs splash from the app instead." = "应用外启动的 splash 服务器正在提供端口 %lld 的服务,因此应用使用了它。按“重启”会改为由应用来运行 splash。";
"The splash this app started exited, but an externally started splash is serving port %lld — the app is using that server. Restart shuts it down and runs splash from the app with the current settings." = "本应用启动的 splash 已退出,但外部启动的 splash 正在提供端口 %lld 的服务 — 应用正使用该服务器。按“重启”会将其关闭,并用当前设置由应用运行 splash。";
"port in use" = "端口已被占用";
"Something else (not splash) is serving port %lld, so the splash the app started exited. Stop that service — or change the port in Settings — then press Start." = "其他程序(非 splash)正在提供端口 %lld 的服务,因此应用启动的 splash 已退出。停止该服务 — 或在“设置”中更改端口 — 然后按“启动”。";
"A service other than splash is listening on port %lld — the splash this app started exited because the port was taken. Stop the other service or change the port in Settings." = "除 splash 外的某个服务正在监听端口 %lld — 本应用启动的 splash 因端口被占用而退出。停止其他服务,或在“设置”中更改端口。";
"splash %@ available" = "splash %@ 可用";
"Update Splash" = "更新 Splash";
"Confirm and update splash to %@ through Homebrew; afterwards the server can be restarted onto it." = "确认并通过 Homebrew 将 splash 更新到 %@;之后可重启服务器以运行新版本。";
"the newest version" = "最新版本";
"Installed: %@. The update runs `brew upgrade %@`." = "已安装:%@。更新将运行 `brew upgrade %@`。";
"A newer splash release is available. Update Splash runs brew upgrade for the splash formula; the server restarts only if you confirm it afterwards." = "有新版 splash 发布可用。“更新 Splash”会为 splash 公式运行 brew upgrade;只有你在之后确认时,服务器才会重启。";
"Splash Menu Bar %@ available" = "Splash Menu Bar %@ 可用";
"Update App" = "更新应用";
"Confirm and update Splash Menu Bar to %@ through Homebrew; the app relaunches afterwards." = "确认并通过 Homebrew 将 Splash Menu Bar 更新到 %@;之后应用会重新启动。";
"Installed: %@. The update runs `brew upgrade --cask splashmenubar`." = "已安装:%@。更新将运行 `brew upgrade --cask splashmenubar`。";
"A newer Splash Menu Bar release is available. Update App runs brew upgrade for the splashmenubar cask; the app relaunches onto it." = "有新版 Splash Menu Bar 发布可用。“更新应用”会为 splashmenubar cask 运行 brew upgrade;应用会重新启动并运行新版本。";
"Get started" = "开始使用";
"Dismiss tip" = "关闭提示";
"Hide this tip." = "隐藏此提示。";
"No splash server is running. Open Settings to choose a splash model, then press ▶ Start. To have the server start whenever the app launches, turn on Start 'splash' server on launch." = "没有 splash 服务器在运行。打开“设置”选择一个 splash 模型,然后按 ▶ 启动。要让服务器随应用启动,请开启“启动时启动 splash 服务器”。";
"Open Settings…" = "打开设置…";
"Choose a model and other splash options." = "选择模型及其他 splash 选项。";
"Engine error" = "引擎错误";
"Metal is reporting a failure; requests may fail or hang until splash is restarted.%@" = "Metal 报告了故障;在重启 splash 之前,请求可能会失败或挂起。%@";
"Engine recovering" = "引擎恢复中";
"The inference engine crashed and is restarting; requests can't be served until it's back.%@" = "推理引擎已崩溃并正在重启;在它恢复之前,请求无法得到处理。%@";
"Engine unstable" = "引擎不稳定";
"The inference engine has crashed and restarted since startup;%@ if it keeps happening, restart splash." = "推理引擎自启动以来已崩溃并重启;%@若反复发生,请重启 splash。";
" Restarted %lld× since startup." = " 启动以来已重启 %lld 次。";
"Yellow: splash is starting (downloading or loading the model)." = "黄色:splash 正在启动(正在下载或加载模型)。";
"Green: splash is running and ready for requests." = "绿色:splash 正在运行,可处理请求。";
"Green: splash is running." = "绿色:splash 正在运行。";
"Red: splash exited unexpectedly (%@). Press Start to run it again." = "红色:splash 意外退出(%@)。按“启动”可再次运行它。";
"Gray: splash is stopped. Press Start to run it." = "灰色:splash 已停止。按“启动”可运行它。";
"Thermal state of this Mac: macOS's system-wide thermal-pressure state, reported to the app through splash.\n%@\nLevels: nominal → fair → serious → critical.\nThe OS sets it from the whole system and changes it slowly, so it can temporarily disagree with the chip temperature shown next to it." = "此 Mac 的热状态:macOS 的系统级热压力状态,通过 splash 报告给应用。\n%@\n级别:正常 → 偏热 → 严重 → 危急。\n该状态由操作系统根据整个系统设定,且变化缓慢,因此可能与旁边显示的芯片温度暂时不一致。";
"Chip temperature: %@ — the hottest CPU/GPU die sensor, read directly by the app (not from splash). The unit follows the Temperature setting; System uses the computer's region." = "芯片温度:%@ — 最热的 CPU/GPU 芯片传感器,由应用直接读取(不来自 splash)。单位遵循“温度”设置;“系统”使用电脑所在区域。";
"Nominal: normal temperature, no thermal limits." = "正常:温度正常,无热限制。";
"Fair: slightly warm. Fans may spin up and macOS may trim background work; speeds are usually unaffected." = "偏热:略有发烫。风扇可能加速,macOS 可能削减后台工作;速度通常不受影响。";
"Serious: hot. macOS is throttling the CPU and GPU, so tok/s and prefill speed will drop." = "严重:发烫。macOS 正在对 CPU 和 GPU 降频,tok/s 和 prefill 速度会下降。";
"Critical: very hot. Heavy throttling until the Mac cools down." = "危急:非常热。在 Mac 冷却之前会大幅降频。";
"Current state: %@." = "当前状态:%@。";
"tok/s" = "tok/s";
"Decode speed: tokens generated per second right now, or the average since splash started when idle. The ring auto-scales to the speed graph's window: full ring = a round number at or above the highest tok/s it shows (the graph's top gridline), so 180 tok/s reads instead of pinning the ring. Below the value: the average of the samples the speed graph shows (its dotted line). Right-click to pick the ring's color." = "解码速度:当前每秒生成的 token 数;空闲时为 splash 启动以来的平均值。圆环自动适配速度图的窗口:满环 = 不低于其显示的最高 tok/s 的整数(即图表顶部网格线),因此 180 tok/s 可以直接读出,而不是把圆环顶满。数值下方:速度图所显示样本的平均值(即其虚线)。右键可选择圆环颜色。";
"prefill" = "prefill";
"While a prompt is prefilling: how much of it is done (the ring fills as it goes) and the estimated time left. Otherwise: prefill speed in tokens per second, from the last prefill or the average since splash started; a full ring = 500 tok/s. Right-click to pick the ring's color." = "提示词正在 prefill 时:显示已完成多少(圆环随之填充)及预计剩余时间。其他情况:prefill 速度(token/秒),取自最近一次 prefill 或 splash 启动以来的平均值;满环 = 500 tok/s。右键可选择圆环颜色。";
"cached" = "已缓存";
"KV cache hit rate since the server started: the share of prompt tokens served from the cache instead of being prefilled again (the per-request figure is LAST REQUEST → Input / cached). Right-click to pick the ring's color." = "服务器启动以来的 KV 缓存命中率:从缓存提供而非重新 prefill 的提示词 token 占比(按请求统计的数字见:最近请求 → 输入 / 已缓存)。右键可选择圆环颜色。";
"GPU" = "GPU";
"GPU use across the whole Mac: share of time the GPU was busy, as Activity Monitor reports it. Right-click to pick the bar's color." = "整台 Mac 的 GPU 使用率:GPU 忙碌时间占比,以 Activity Monitor 的报告为准。右键可选择条形颜色。";
"CPU" = "CPU";
"CPU use across the whole Mac: share of all cores' time spent busy since the last refresh. Right-click to pick the bar's color." = "整台 Mac 的 CPU 使用率:自上次刷新以来所有核心忙碌时间占比。右键可选择条形颜色。";
"RAM" = "RAM";
"Memory used across the whole Mac (app memory + wired + compressed, as Activity Monitor counts it): %@ of %@" = "整台 Mac 已用内存(应用内存 + 已线定 + 压缩,以 Activity Monitor 的统计口径为准):%@ / %@";
"Memory used across the whole Mac (app memory + wired + compressed, as Activity Monitor counts it)" = "整台 Mac 已用内存(应用内存 + 已线定 + 压缩,以 Activity Monitor 的统计口径为准)";
"%@. The bar's color follows the server's memory-pressure report — %@" = "%@。条形颜色跟随服务器的内存压力报告 — %@";
"green = normal, yellow = warning, red = critical" = "绿色 = 正常,黄色 = 警告,红色 = 危急";
"%@; the server hasn't reported one yet." = "%@;服务器尚未报告过。";
"normal — the Mac has memory to spare" = "正常 — Mac 的内存有余量";
"warning — the system is under memory load; splash's requests may be slower or suspended" = "警告 — 系统内存负载较高;splash 的请求可能变慢或被挂起";
"critical — macOS is reclaiming memory aggressively; splash may refuse or drop requests until it eases off" = "危急 — macOS 正在积极回收内存;splash 可能拒绝或丢弃请求,直到压力缓解";
"%@; right now: %@" = "%@;当前:%@";
"Output (last)" = "输出(最近)";
"Tokens the last request generated." = "最近一个请求生成的 token 数。";
"Input / cached" = "输入 / 已缓存";
"Prompt tokens of the last request / how many of them were reused from the prompt cache instead of being prefilled again. Of the uncached rest, a further share could still read KV that other requests had already computed — the niche \"deduplicated\" figure, no longer shown as its own row." = "最近一个请求的提示词 token 数 / 其中多少从提示词缓存复用而非重新 prefill。在未被缓存的其余部分中,还有一部分本可以直接读取其他请求已计算好的 KV — 即小众的“去重”数字,不再单独成行显示。";
"TTFT (last)" = "TTFT(最近)";
"Time to first token of the last request: from arrival until its first output token (mostly prefill)." = "最近一个请求的首 token 时间:从到达直到其第一个输出 token(主要是 prefill)。";
"Tok/cycle" = "Tok/周期";
"Tokens produced per decode cycle with the draft model: 1 + accepted draft tokens per cycle. Higher means speculative decoding is paying off." = "使用草稿模型时每个 decode 周期产生的 token 数:1 + 每周期被接受的草稿 token 数。数值越高,说明推测解码越划算。";
"Requests" = "请求";
"Requests completed since splash started, plus any cancelled or failed." = "splash 启动以来已完成的请求,另加已取消或失败的。";
"Prefill" = "Prefill";
"Progress of the prompt being processed now: % done · tokens remaining · estimated time left at the current prefill speed." = "正在处理的提示词的进度:已完成 % · 剩余 token 数 · 按当前 prefill 速度估算的剩余时间。";
" · %@ left" = " · 剩余 %@";
" · ~%@ left" = " · 约剩 %@";
"Decode" = "Decode";
"Progress of a request generating now: tokens produced · time spent generating · estimated time left when the request has a max-tokens cap (at the current decode speed)." = "正在生成的请求的进度:已生成 token 数 · 生成耗时 · 当请求设有最大 token 上限时,按当前 decode 速度估算的剩余时间。";
"TTFT (p50 / p95)" = "TTFT(p50 / p95)";
"Time to first token across requests: median / 95th percentile." = "各请求的首 token 时间:中位数 / 第 95 百分位。";
"ITL (p50 / p95)" = "ITL(p50 / p95)";
"Inter-token latency: the time between consecutive output tokens while generating, across requests (median / 95th percentile). For one stream at a time this is the perceived speed — 1000 ÷ ITL tokens per second — so lower is better." = "token 间延迟:生成时连续两个输出 token 之间的时间,跨请求统计(中位数 / 第 95 百分位)。一次只有一个流时,这就是感知速度 — 每秒 1000 ÷ ITL 个 token — 因此越低越好。";
"Prefill / decode" = "Prefill / Decode";
"Average speeds since splash started: prompt processing (prefill) / generation (decode)." = "splash 启动以来的平均速度:提示词处理(prefill)/ 生成(decode)。";
"Draft accept" = "草稿接受率";
"Speculative decoding (a draft model proposing tokens ahead) is not in use: the server reports no drafted tokens, so the main model generates every token alone." = "未使用推测解码(由草稿模型预先提议 token):服务器报告没有草稿 token,因此主模型独自生成每个 token。";
"Speculative decoding: the share of the draft model's proposed tokens the main model accepted (%@ drafted since startup). Higher means the draft pays off; below ~40% it barely helps. LAST REQUEST's Tok/cycle is the same idea per request." = "推测解码:主模型接受的草稿模型所提议 token 的占比(启动以来共产出 %@ 个草稿 token)。占比越高,说明草稿模型越划算;低于约 40% 则几乎帮不上忙。最近请求的 Tok/周期就是按请求看的同一指标。";
"Total output" = "总输出";
"Tokens generated across all requests since splash started." = "splash 启动以来所有请求生成的 token 总数。";
"Active" = "进行中";
"Requests in flight right now: generating (decode) · processing their prompt (prefill) · waiting their turn (queued), plus how long the longest-waiting request has waited." = "当前处理中的请求:正在生成(decode)· 正在处理提示词(prefill)· 排队等待(queued),以及等待最久的请求已等待多久。";
"splash (server)" = "splash(服务器)";
"Memory the splash server itself currently holds, as it reports it (— when it doesn't), plus its peak since the server started. Different from the RAM bar in the gauges, which is the whole Mac's memory use." = "splash 服务器自身当前占用的内存(按其自报;未报告时显示 —),以及服务器启动以来的峰值。与仪表中的 RAM 条形不同,后者是整台 Mac 的内存使用。";
"KV cache" = "KV 缓存";
"KV cache: server memory held for prompt context, and how many prompt tokens were served from it since startup instead of being prefilled again — high reuse is why similar prompts run fast." = "KV 缓存:服务器为提示词上下文保留的内存,以及启动以来有多少提示词 token 直接取自其中而非重新 prefill — 复用率高就是相似提示词运行快的原因。";
"Uptime" = "运行时间";
"Time since the server started." = "服务器启动以来的时间。";
"%@ done" = "已完成 %@";
" · %@ cancelled" = " · 已取消 %@";
" · %@ failed" = " · 失败 %@";
"idle" = "空闲";
"%lld decode · %lld prefill · %lld queued" = "%lld decode · %lld prefill · %lld 排队";
" · waiting %@" = " · 已等待 %@";
