" · %lld failed" = " · %lld 失败";
"How long loading the model weights took at startup, plus their lifecycle. splash releases the weights from memory after %lld s of idleness to give the RAM back, so the next request restores them (\"reloading\") and is slower." = "启动时加载模型权重的耗时,及其生命周期。splash 在空闲 %lld 秒后会将权重从内存中释放以归还 RAM,因此下一个请求会将其恢复(“重新加载中”),速度会变慢。";
"How long loading the model weights took at startup, plus their lifecycle. splash can release the weights from memory after idleness to give the RAM back, so the next request restores them (\"reloading\") and is slower." = "启动时加载模型权重的耗时,及其生命周期。splash 可以在空闲后将权重从内存中释放以归还 RAM,因此下一个请求会将其恢复(“重新加载中”),速度会变慢。";
" · writes gated" = " · 写入受限";
"Persistent cache on disk (Settings: --max-cache-disk / --persistent-cache): used / limit." = "磁盘上的持久缓存(设置:--max-cache-disk / --persistent-cache):已用 / 上限。";
"Persistent cache on disk (Settings: --max-cache-disk / --persistent-cache): used / limit. \"writes gated\" means splash is pausing cache writes (budget or disk full), so new context may not be cached." = "磁盘上的持久缓存(设置:--max-cache-disk / --persistent-cache):已用 / 上限。“写入受限”表示 splash 正在暂停缓存写入(预算用尽或磁盘已满),因此新上下文可能不会被缓存。";
"age %@ · tick %@" = "快照时长 %@ · 循环耗时 %@";
