"Manage…" = "管理…";
"The Hugging Face cache (~/.cache/huggingface/hub) where splash keeps downloaded models, including the separate versions of a repo it has fetched. Manage lists them, downloads new models, and removes what's no longer wanted." = "splash 存放已下载模型的 Hugging Face 缓存(~/.cache/huggingface/hub),包括其已拉取的 repo 的各个独立版本。“管理”可列出它们、下载新模型,并删除不再需要的内容。";
"Pin model version" = "固定模型版本";
"--revision: pin splash to the commit of the model already in the Hugging Face cache, so a new commit on the repository's default branch is not re-downloaded over the copy on disk. Off by default, when splash follows the default branch. With no complete copy in the cache there is no version to pin, so the first start downloads as usual and only restarts after are pinned." = "--revision:将 splash 固定到 Hugging Face 缓存中已有模型的 commit,这样仓库默认分支上的新 commit 就不会重新下载并覆盖磁盘上的副本。默认关闭,此时 splash 跟随默认分支。若缓存中没有完整副本,就没有可固定的版本,因此首次启动照常下载,只有之后的重启才会被固定。";
"Point a coding harness at the splash server. Auto Connect writes the harness's own configuration, so it uses splash from a terminal too; start it in a new session after connecting. Every supported harness is listed; the uninstalled ones can be connected once their binary is on the PATH." = "让编码框架指向 splash 服务器。自动连接会写入框架自身的配置,因此它在终端中也会使用 splash;连接后请在新会话中启动它。所有受支持的框架都会列出;未安装的框架,一旦其二进制文件在 PATH 上即可连接。";
