"Idle release" = "空闲释放";
"10m default (e.g. off)" = "默认 10m(例如 off)";
"--idle-release: time without a request before splash frees the model weights and memory, e.g. 30m, 1h; off keeps them loaded. Blank = 10m." = "--idle-release:splash 释放模型权重和内存前的无请求时长,例如 30m、1h;off 表示保持加载。留空 = 10m。";
"Max context" = "最大上下文";
"auto (e.g. 100K)" = "自动(例如 100K)";
"--max-context: context token limit, e.g. 100K or 1M. Past the model's native window (256K) it turns on YaRN, which changes answers, so go higher only when needed. Blank = auto." = "--max-context:上下文 token 上限,例如 100K 或 1M。超过模型原生窗口(256K)时会启用 YaRN,这会使答案发生变化,因此只在需要时调高。留空 = 自动。";
