"bf16" = "bf16";
"--kv-format: storage for the KV cache. int8 (default) uses less memory; bf16 uses more." = "--kv-format:KV 缓存的存储格式。int8(默认)占用内存更少;bf16 占用更多。";
"State format" = "状态格式";
"fp32 (default)" = "fp32(默认)";
"--state-format: storage for recurrent state. fp32 (default); bf16 halves each state, so memory and the SSD cache hold about twice as many." = "--state-format:循环状态的存储格式。fp32(默认);bf16 将每个状态减半,因此内存和 SSD 缓存大约可多容纳一倍。";
"Max cache disk" = "最大缓存磁盘";
"auto (e.g. 16G; 0 = off)" = "自动(例如 16G;0 = 关闭)";
"--max-cache-disk: SSD quota for cached KV pages and states, e.g. 16G; 0 disables the SSD cache. Blank = auto (a quarter of free space, at most 32G)." = "--max-cache-disk:缓存的 KV 页和状态的 SSD 配额,例如 16G;0 表示禁用 SSD 缓存。留空 = 自动(可用空间的四分之一,最多 32G)。";
"Language only" = "仅语言";
"--language-only: skip loading vision; image and PDF input is refused. Saves memory and startup time." = "--language-only:跳过加载视觉模块;拒绝图像和 PDF 输入。可节省内存和启动时间。";
"Disable Neural Engine" = "禁用神经引擎";
"--disable-ane: prefill on the GPU alone. By default long prompts on dense models also use the Neural Engine when that's faster." = "--disable-ane:仅用 GPU 做 prefill。默认情况下,稠密模型的长提示词在神经引擎更快的情况下也会使用神经引擎。";
"Persistent cache" = "持久缓存";
"--persistent-cache: keep the SSD prompt cache across restarts, so earlier conversations resume without re-prefilling." = "--persistent-cache:在重启之间保留 SSD 提示词缓存,这样之前的对话可以恢复,无需重新 prefill。";
