"Auto-restart" = "自动重启";
"If splash exits on its own, start it again after a moment — up to %lld times in a row before giving up. Pressing Start resets the count; a Stop always wins over it. A crash also gets a notification unless it is being auto-restarted." = "如果 splash 自行退出,稍等片刻后再次启动 — 连续最多 %lld 次,之后放弃。按“启动”会重置计数;“停止”始终优先于它。崩溃时也会收到通知,除非正在自动重启。";
"Start 'splash' server on launch" = "启动时启动 splash 服务器";
