"Relaunch to apply the language?" = "重新启动以应用语言？";
"The new language takes effect when Splash Menu Bar relaunches. The splash server keeps running." = "新语言将在 Splash Menu Bar 重新启动后生效。splash 服务器将继续运行。";
"The app's UI language. System (the default) follows the computer's language — System Settings → General → Language & Region — and falls back to English when the system language isn't supported. Saving a different language relaunches the app to apply it; the splash server keeps running." = "应用界面语言。系统（默认）跟随电脑的语言 — 系统设置 → 通用 → 语言与地区 — 系统语言不受支持时回退到英语。保存其他语言后会重新启动应用以应用；splash 服务器继续运行。";
